#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<h2>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/showimg.png\">\n"
"&nbsp;Welcome to ShowImg\n"
"</h2>\n"
"<p>\n"
"You can check for a new version at the\n"
"<center><a href=\"http://www.jalix.org/projects/showimg\">ShowImg project "
"page</a></center>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<h2>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/showimg.png\">\n"
"&nbsp;Benvido ao ShowImg\n"
"</h2>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Pode procurar novas versóns na\n"
"<center><a href=\"http://www.xalix.org/proxects/showimg\">"
"páxina do proxecto ShowImg</a></center>\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:15
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>rename</b> your images using 'Tools' -> <img "
"src=\"../apps/showimg/icons/hicolor/16x16/actions/item_rename.png\" "
"width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Batch&nbsp;rename'?</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...pode <b>renomear</b> as suas imaxes usando 'Ferramentas' -> <img "
"src=\"../apps/showimg/icons/hicolor/16x16/actions/item_rename.png\" "
"width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Renomear&nbsp;en&nbsp;lote'?</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:20
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can search <b>similar</b> images by using 'Tools' -> "
"'Find&nbsp;images' -> 'Similar&nbsp;images'?</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...que pode procurar imaxes <b>semellantes</b> utilizando 'Ferramentas' -> "
"'Procurar&nbsp;Imaxes' -> 'Imaxes&nbsp;Semellantes'?</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:25
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>convert</b> image format by using 'Tools' -> 'Convert' "
"-> 'Format'?</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...que pode <b>converter</b> a imaxe de formato utilizando 'Ferramentas' -> "
"'Converter' -> 'Formato'?</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:30
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"...that ShowImg can use the <b><a "
"href=\"http://digikam.sourceforge.net/\">digikam</a> plugins</b>?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Use 'Setting' -> 'Configure&nbsp;showimg' -> 'Plugins' to choose plugins "
"you want to enable.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<p>\n"
"You can see screenshots at the <a "
"href=\"http://digikam.sourceforge.net/plugins.html\">digikam plugins "
"page</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"...que o ShowImg pode utilizar <b><i>plugins</i> <a "
"href=\"http://digiKam.sourceforxe.net/\">digiKam</a>?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Utilice 'Configurazón' -> 'Configurar&nbsp;showimg' -> "
"'Plugins' para escoller os <i>plugins</i> que desexa activar.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Pode ver imaxes na <a href=\"http://digiKam.sourceforxe.net/plugins.html\">"
"páxina de <i>plugins</i> do digiKam</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:43
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>extract images</b> in archives (<tt>.tar, "
".zip,...</tt>) using drag'n'drop?</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...quer pode <b>extrair imaxes</b> en ficheiro (<tt>.tar, .cip,...</tt>"
") simplesmente arrastando e soltando?</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:48
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>fit to screen</b> images using <img "
"src=\"../apps/showimg/icons/hicolor/32x32/actions/viewmag_enlarge.png\" "
"width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Shrink if bigger' and &nbsp;<img "
"src=\"../apps/showimg/icons/hicolor/32x32/actions/viewmag_shrink.png\" "
"width=\"16\" height=\"16\">'Enlarge if smaller'?</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...pode <b>axustar á pantalla</b> as suas imaxes usando <img "
"src=\"../apps/showimg/icons/hicolor/32x32/actions/viewmag_enlarge.png\" "
"width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Reducir se maior' e &nbsp;<img "
"src=\"../apps/showimg/icons/hicolor/32x32/actions/viewmag_shrink.png\" "
"width=\"16\" height=\"16\">'Aumentar se menor'?</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:53
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>rotate</b> image files using 'Tools' -> 'Convert' -> "
"<img src=\"../apps/showimg/icons/hicolor/16x16/actions/rotation_acw.png\" "
"width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Rotate left' and <img "
"src=\"../apps/showimg/icons/hicolor/16x16/actions/rotation_cw.png\" "
"width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Rotate right'?</p>\n"
"<p>Moreover, if the <tt>jpegtran</tt> program is installed then JPEG files "
"rotations are lossless rotation.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...pode <b>rotar</b> as imaxes usando 'Ferramentaas' -> 'Converter' -> "
"<img src=\"../apps/showimg/icons/hicolor/16x16/actions/rotation_acw.png\" "
"width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Rotar á esquerda' e <img "
"src=\"../apps/showimg/icons/hicolor/16x16/actions/rotation_cw.png\" "
"width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Rotar á direita'?</p>\n"
"<p>Ademais, se o programa <tt>jpegtran</tt> está instalado entón poderá rotar ficheiros JPEG sen perdas de calidade.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:59
msgid ""
"<p>...that using <b>albums</b> can drag'n'drop icons from the icon view to "
"the album icon to select and manage images?</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...que ao utilizar <b>álbuns</b> pode arrastar e soltar ícones da vista por "
"ícones para o ícone do álbun para escoller e xerir imaxes?</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:64
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can download and <b>display <tt>ftp/http</tt> URL files</b>? "
"Just write the URL in the <img "
"src=\"crystalsvg/22x22/actions/locationbar_erase.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;location&nbsp;toolbar and press enter.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...que pode descarregar e  <b>mostrar ficheiros desde URLs <tt>ftp/http</tt></b>? "
"Simplesmente escreba a URL na <img "
"src=\"crystalsvg/22x22/actions/locationbar_erase.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;barra&nbsp;de&nbsp;localizazón e prema enter.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:69
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>browse 'offline' your CD</b> with pictures by viewing "
"the thumbnails?</p>\n"
"<p>Choose the tab <img src=\"crystalsvg/16x16/mimetypes/cdimage.png\"  "
"width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n"
"&nbsp;'CD Archive View', click on 'New Archive CD' then select your CD-ROM "
"path: your CD will be parsed and the thumbnails will be store on your hard "
"drive and can be easily browsed.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...pode <b>navegar desconectaro o seu CD</b> de imaxes ollandos as miniaturas?</p>\n"
"<p>Escolla a pestana <img src=\"crystalsvg/16x16/mimetypes/cdimage.png\"  "
"width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n"
"&nbsp;'Vista de Arquivos de CD', prema en 'Novo Arquivo de CD' enton escolla o seu CD-ROM: o seu CD será procesado e as miniaturas serán guardadas no seus disco duro para ser facilmente navegábeis.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:76
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>managed you images by using 'Categories'</b>?</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Choose the tab <img src=\"hicolor/16x16/apps/kexi.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Category View'.\n"
"Categories allows to tag images in order to find then easily. One picture "
"can have several tags.\n"
"One category can have sub-categories, for example the category 'People' can "
"have sub-categories 'Friends' and 'Familly'.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...pode <b>xestionar as suar imaxes usando 'Categorias'</b>?</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Escolla a pestana <img src=\"hicolor/16x16/apps/kexi.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Vista de Categorias'.\n"
"As categorias permiten marcar as imaxes para atopá-las facilmente. Unha imaxe pode ter várias marcas.\n"
"Unha categoria pode ter sub-categorias, por exemplo a categoria 'Xente' pode "
"ter as subcategorias 'Amigos' e 'Familia'.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:86
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>mixed your category criteria</b>?</p>\n"
"<p>For example if you want to display all pictures of you friend 'Robert' in "
"'Paris', then check both 'Robert' and 'Paris' category checkbox items.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...pode <b>misturar os critérios de categorizazón</b>?</p>\n"
"<p>Por exemplo se quere ver as fotos do seu amigo 'Roberto' en "
"'Paris', entón marque ambas as categorias</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:92
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>give a note</b> to your pictures?</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Drag'n'drop your pictures over the <img "
"src=\"crystalsvg/16x16/actions/flag.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;note you want to set.<br>\n"
"  Click on the note to display  all  pictures having this note.<br>\n"
"  Click on two notes to display all pictures having note setting between "
"both these notes.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...pode <b>pontuar</b> as suas fotos?</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  Arraste e Solte as suas fotos sobre a <img "
"src=\"crystalsvg/16x16/actions/flag.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;nota que lles queira dar.<br>\n"
"  Prema na nota para mostrar todas as imaxes que teñan esa nota.<br>\n"
"  Prema en duas notas para mostrar todas as imaxes que teñan notas entre as duas escollidas.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:102
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>search by name</b> images?</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Choose the tab <img src=\"hicolor/16x16/apps/kexi.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Category View' and click on <img "
"src=\"crystalsvg/16x16/actions/filefind.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Search\"'\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...pode <b>buscar por nome</b> nas imaxes?</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Escolla a pestana <img src=\"hicolor/16x16/apps/kexi.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Vista en Categorias' e prema en <img "
"src=\"crystalsvg/16x16/actions/filefind.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Procurar\"'\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:110
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>search by date</b> images?</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Choose the tab <img src=\"hicolor/16x16/apps/kexi.png\">&nbsp;'Category "
"View' and click on <img src=\"crystalsvg/16x16/apps/date.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Date'.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...pode <b>buscar por data</b> as suas imaxes?</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Escolla a pestana <img src=\"hicolor/16x16/apps/kexi.png\">&nbsp;'Vista en Categorias' e prema en <img src=\"crystalsvg/16x16/apps/date.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Data'.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:118
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>mix all criteria</b> in <img "
"src=\"hicolor/16x16/apps/kexi.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Category View'?</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Just check all checkboxes you want to add and choose between <img "
"src=\"./hicolor/22x22/actions/raise.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">'Add' "
"and <img src=\"./hicolor/22x22/actions/lower.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">'Or' in the toolbar to join them.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...pode <b>misturar todos os critérios</b> na <img "
"src=\"hicolor/16x16/apps/kexi.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">&nbsp;'Vista en Categorias'?</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Simplesmente marque todas as opzóns que queira engadir e escolla entre <img "
"src=\"./hicolor/22x22/actions/raise.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">'E' "
"e <img src=\"./hicolor/22x22/actions/lower.png\" width=\"16\" "
"height=\"16\">'OU' na barra de ferramentas para uni-las.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:126
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>copy</b> your selected files <b>into the last "
"directory</b> you move files by pressing '<b>F12</b>' (default key)?</p>\n"
msgstr "<p>...pode <b>copiar</b> os seus ficheiros escollidos <b>no último directório</b> ao que movese ficheiros premendo '<b>F12</b>' (configurábel)?</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:131
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can <b>play video file<b> into showimg?</p>\n"
"<p>You can choose the embeded player in 'Configure'/'Configure "
"Showimg'/'Video'.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...pode <b>reproducir vídeos<b> en showimg?</p>\n"
"<p>Pode escoller o reprodutor a empotrar en 'Configurar'/'Configurar "
"Showimg'/'Vídeo'.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:137
msgid ""
"<p>...that you have read all the tooltips and you can contribute to ShowImg "
"(add feature, write documention, ...) by <a "
"href='mailto:rgroult@jalix.org'>contacting me</a> by email.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...leu todas as axudas e que pode contribuir a ShowImg "
"(nova funzón, escreber documentazón, ...) <a "
"href='mailto:rgroult@jalix.org'>contactando-me</a> por email.</p>\n"

